# Hollow Scavenger: "Sacrifice a Food" is a cost only its controller can pay with a Food they control (CR 118.3, 701.21a).
# Bot1's Wolf is on the battlefield with {1} ready, but Bot1 has no Food; Bot2's Bakery Raid (the Adventure half of its own
# Hollow Scavenger) made Bot2 one, and that Food cannot be sacrificed by Bot1, so the activation is refused (the first
# check: the Wolf is still 3/2 and the Food is still Bot2's).

